<title>AUSTRIA: EVN 95/6 net profit flat at 667 mln ATS.</title>
<headline>EVN 95/6 net profit flat at 667 mln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian regional utility Energieversorgung Niederoesterreich (EVN) said on Tuesday it posted a net profit of 667 million schillings in 1995/6, unchanged from the previous year.</p>
<p>Company spokesman Georg Male said EVN paid 469 million schillings in tax in 1995/6, up from 180 million schillings the previous year, offsetting a 24.4 percent jump in pre-tax profit. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
